从 dev 分支精确提取音频相关改动:
- Add OHOS host-broker audio backend (87fed739)
- Add MP3 fallback to audio smoke sample (d6d64ad2)
- OHOS audio tweaks (db3b9418, audio files only)
- improve WineHua audio smoke diagnostics (107d79f6, audio files only)
- stabilize pad audio and desktop runtime (6535c89a, audio files only)
